{"c":[{"name":"20261002T113723Z-250b757576dc3838","text":"Synthetic HID keys go to LaunchServices' front app, not the owner of the frontmost window; guard on lsappinfo front before typing into a fixture.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261002T114801Z-32531afb7e4fe1e0","text":"caret-screen write/press verbs act only in --act-pids, which must be a subset of --only-pids; without it the reader only reads. Rechecks fail closed on unreadable role/subrole/value/label.","type":"note"}]}
